1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,412
Why does your dog stare at you while it poops?

2
00:00:02,462 --> 00:00:03,951
It's not being weird.

3
00:00:04,001 --> 00:00:07,756
For a dog, pooping is one of its most vulnerable moments.

4
00:00:07,806 --> 00:00:11,158
In the wild, that's exactly when a predator could strike.

5
00:00:11,208 --> 00:00:13,596
So your dog looks to you to keep watch.

6
00:00:13,646 --> 00:00:15,533
And here's the strangest part.

7
00:00:15,583 --> 00:00:19,929
In a study of 70 dogs, they preferred to line up north to south.

8
00:00:19,979 --> 00:00:22,859
But only when Earth's magnetic field was calm.

9
00:00:22,909 --> 00:00:24,707
So that stare means one thing.

10
00:00:24,757 --> 00:00:26,328
You're their bodyguard.

11
00:00:26,378 --> 00:00:30,146
Send this to a dog owner who needs to know.
